        <rule id="2e4bbfb8-c1c8-5af5-a438-6d62afcf0733" name="Flesh Shaper" hidden="false">
          <description>This model and its unit will always Hold instead of pursuing a fleeing unit (if it is Kroot) and automatically pass the Ld test. When it does so, this model and its unit may reroll failed To Hit rolls against any unit using the defeated Datasheet until the end of the game.</description>
        </rule>
