        <rule id="e8047183-32f5-5b52-b79e-4702d47d03ca" name="Goaded" hidden="false">
          <description>This model is fielded as a separate unit from the Shaper and Kroot. This model will Charge and Attack the closest model, friend or foe, unless a Shaper or Kroot from any unit are within 6”. If it is Charging or Attacking friendly forces, you may treat it as an enemy.</description>
